  "content": "<h1>西班牙美食</h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/DevJulen/SpanishDelight-1.20.1-Forge/blob/master/src/main/resources/spanishdelightbanner.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Spanish Delight\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>西班牙美食</strong> 是一款基于 <strong>农夫乐事</strong> 烹饪系统扩展的模组，引入了西班牙传统菜肴，如西班牙土豆饼、冷汤等。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在世界中探索新食材，烹制美味佳肴！</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⚙️ <strong>依赖项：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">运行此模组需要 <strong>农夫乐事</strong> 和 Forge，同时强烈建议安装 <strong>JEI</strong>（Just Enough Items）！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧾 <strong>更多信息：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">我计划在未来添加更多食物，并推出 Fabric 版本。如果您希望此模组支持其他 Minecraft 版本，请留言告知！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">📝 <strong>致谢：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由 DevJulen 开发</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">非常感谢 vectorwing 创建了农夫乐事 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">非常感谢 ArBeet 创作了所有素材！ <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fArBeeeet\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://x.com/ArBeeeet</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌐 <strong>社交账号：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Twitter: <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fDevJulen\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://x.com/DevJulen</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Instagram: <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.instagram.com%252fdevjulen%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.instagram.com/devjulen</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Itch.io: <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdevjulen.itch.io%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://devjulen.itch.io</a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;未定义</p>",
